--  The system directory (ADR 0035), which init creates at install and
--  gives login, and login gives petal. It is the same for every user, and
--  holds special files such as null. Petal has it as a Fixed_Directory
--  (ADR 0036, section 3): nobody can change what is in it, but its
--  special files are their Streams. A command never gets it by default,
--  only as an argument the user names.

role Files.System_Directory : Files.Fixed_Directory;
